            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "This was likely introduced by https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/pull/5603 (backported in https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/pull/5712). I'm looking into it now to confirm that's the issue and to see what we can do to fix the regression.",
